# Two products

The app is Welcome Hub and Creative ECOsystem. ECO is capitalized. Never write "Creative Eco".

- Welcome Hub is the front door for `pending` and `student`. Accent `#8B1A1A`. Do not paint it orange.
- Creative ECOsystem is the other tab, for `pending`, `student`, and `alumni`. Actions use orange `#EA580C`.
- Alumni never see Welcome Hub. They land on the portfolio, same as `RequireStudentAuth` sending `role === alumni` off `/welcome`.
- Admin may sign in and use the student app. Do not build dashboard, quick links, moderation, or analytics.
- Industry gets no Welcome Hub. Reduced Creative only: portfolio, collabs, and jobs, behind their flags.
- Prospects stay out. They belong to the vfs.edu embed. Sign-in returns an error and no bearer token.

`pending` is a real `users.role`. A new @vfs.com or @vfs.edu magic-link account is created as `student`. Any other email is created as `pending`. Promotion to student happens on the website when they later sign in with a VFS email. Do not promote them in the app. `/api/me` returns `role` as stored.

Announcements have no `pending` value. A `student` target is also shown to `pending`. Welcome Hub student announcements and `welcome_hub` SiteNotifications stay on the Welcome tab. `creative_community` SiteNotifications stay on the Creative tab. Drafts stay hidden. Do not publish the Storyhive draft.

